<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Boston Scientific as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Boston Scientific as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- JP Morgan said it initiated coverage of Boston Scientific Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- analyst Michael Weinstein called the stock &quot;our top pick in the medical device sector.&quot;</p>
<p>-- estimated earnings of $1.60 per share for 1996 and $2.15 for 1997.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 5/8 to 49-3/4.</p>
</text>
